  "learnDiagramPolicySemantic": "Diagram comparing three parts of app privacy. First, Policy says: the developer's written promise. Second, Phone shows: the permissions allowed on this phone. Third, inside a dashed boundary, Still unknown: live internet traffic that Enprive cannot see. A privacy policy is a promise, not proof of behavior.",
